    5163   00:5B7D                          ; now oti the data starting at hl, size is in DE
    5164   00:5B7D                          ; Grauw Optimized 16 bit loop, handy for us, mostly since we can use outi :-D
    5165   00:5B7D  43                      ld  b,e                         ;Number of loops originaly in DE
